{"4373670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "IMProper", "steam_appid": 4373670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accidentally teleported to the realm of the angels and wrongfully accused, a small imp obsessed with order must clean his name. Explore an overworld, clean with magic spells, and overcome challenges to progress through the different biomes and the story. But beware, your OCD may help you… or turn against you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4373670/extras/e33ddcf254fc669a4d2d33e1a127d868.webp?t=1777931473\" width=268 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coming into contact with dirt and disorder triggers your Obsessive-Compulsive Disorder (OCD). Staying calm allows you to use magic; losing control transforms you and changes the rules of the game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4373670/extras/77489834e13275fa8870ae99a389f02d.poster.avif?t=1777931473\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4373670/extras/77489834e13275fa8870ae99a389f02d.webm?t=1777931473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4373670/extras/77489834e13275fa8870ae99a389f02d.mp4?t=1777931473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4373670/extras/45c0fd5b71b0fe8370e17d66cbf3c600.avif?t=1777931473\" width=560 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine cleaning and order-based spells to solve puzzles, unlock new paths, and leave every level spotless. Use water to clean, a magical vacuum to absorb dust, telekinesis to organize the environment, and many other spells waiting to be discovered.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4373670/extras/84f37d7e5a093fa7de62407461edc7ee.poster.avif?t=1777931473\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4373670/extras/84f37d7e5a093fa7de62407461edc7ee.webm?t=1777931473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4373670/extras/84f37d7e5a093fa7de62407461edc7ee.mp4?t=1777931473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4373670/extras/3cc9835bbe8c1b650ac5b7ec76edb0b7.avif?t=1777931473\" width=441 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an overworld filled with environmental puzzles and hidden secrets. Roam its areas, uncover what lies around every corner, and access different levels… you never know what you’ll find.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4373670/extras/38b1b026366834c3dafbf57e18338ee6.poster.avif?t=1777931473\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4373670/extras/38b1b026366834c3dafbf57e18338ee6.webm?t=1777931473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4373670/extras/38b1b026366834c3dafbf57e18338ee6.mp4?t=1777931473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4373670/extras/752051f3bd507c920548479d34d3bb9f.webp?t=1777931473\" width=447 height=39 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the trail of disorder to uncover who’s really behind the chaos.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4373670/extras/f8a4f601071068b39428f815f043e29d.poster.avif?t=1777931473\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4373670/extras/f8a4f601071068b39428f815f043e29d.webm?t=1777931473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4373670/extras/f8a4f601071068b39428f815f043e29d.mp4?t=1777931473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accidentally teleported to the realm of the angels and wrongfully accused, a small imp obsessed with order must clean his name. Explore an overworld, clean with magic spells, and overcome challenges to progress through the different biomes and the story. But beware, your OCD may help you… or turn against you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4373670/extras/e33ddcf254fc669a4d2d33e1a127d868.webp?t=1777931473\" width=268 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coming into contact with dirt and disorder triggers your Obsessive-Compulsive Disorder (OCD). Staying calm allows you to use magic; losing control transforms you and changes the rules of the game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4373670/extras/77489834e13275fa8870ae99a389f02d.poster.avif?t=1777931473\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4373670/extras/77489834e13275fa8870ae99a389f02d.webm?t=1777931473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4373670/extras/77489834e13275fa8870ae99a389f02d.mp4?t=1777931473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4373670/extras/45c0fd5b71b0fe8370e17d66cbf3c600.avif?t=1777931473\" width=560 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine cleaning and order-based spells to solve puzzles, unlock new paths, an